MID_OmaState: Ogmios
MID_DananSea: Mer de Danann
MID_LilSea: Mer de Lir
MID_LucileSea: Mer de Lucir
MID_Solomon: Solomon
MID_EventLocation_Zaras: Ténèbres de Zahras
MID_EventLocation_Obelisk: Chambre aux obélisques
MID_EventLocation_SeaGod: Domaine de Cetus
MID_EventLocation_Zenzel: Paradis de Zenzele
MID_EventLocation_MarchingBase: Base d'opérations
MID_EventLocation_Unknown: ???
MID_EventLocation_SomeWhere: Quelque part
MID_EventLocation_OnWay: En chemin
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleDagsa: Temple de Dagda
MID_EventLocation_DagsionArena: Arène
MID_EventLocation_UnderDagsionArena: Sous-sol de l'arène
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleCarla: Temple de Kalla
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleSmyrnos: Temple de Smyrnos
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleClaire: Temple de Credna
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleAurora: Temple d'Aurora
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleJuFas: Temple de Yu Phas
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleJura: Temple de Jurah
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleSoleil: Temple de Solel
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleMars: Temple de Mars
MID_EventLocation_CrystalPalace: Palace Cristallin
MID_EventLocation_NearDagsion: Près de Dagsion
MID_EventLocation_RoundTable: Salle du conseil
MID_EventLocation_Sea: En mer
MID_EventLocation_TheZaratan: Le Zaratan
MID_EventLocation_Hideout: Repaire
MID_EventLocation_MountOrgus: Mont Orgus
MID_EventLocation_MountAtla: Mont Atla
MID_EventLocation_UnderWorld: Les Limbes
MID_EventLocation_DagsaCauldron: Chaudron de Dagda